 "remarks": "Welcome to effortless, modern living at 65 Glenbrook Road, #1E in the heart of Stamford! This beautifully renovated 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom condo with doorman service has been completely transformed with brand-new finishes throughout, offering a truly move-in-ready experience. Every detail has been thoughtfully updated, including a stunning new kitchen, beautifully redesigned bathroom, modern lighting, updated electrical, and contemporary finishes that create a fresh, sophisticated feel. What truly sets this unit apart is its exceptional ground-floor location, offering the ultimate in everyday convenience. Forget the elevators and stairs, this residence is located just steps from the building's lobby, with its assigned parking space conveniently situated right outside the unit for easy access. Adding even more value, heat, water, and gas are included in the HOA fee. Public transportation is available directly across the street, while shopping, restaurants, and everyday essentials are all close by. Enjoy a 15-minute walk to Downtown Stamford, Shopping, Restaurants, Metro-North train station, providing convenient rail service to Grand Central Terminal & New Haven.  Combining the feel of a brand-new interior with the accessibility of ground-floor living and an unbeatable Stamford location, this turnkey condo offers the perfect blend of style, comfort, and convenience. Just unpack and enjoy!",
